Package: rAT1000
Title: Import and Visualize OLSA AT1000 Measurements
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Andreas F.", "Kandolf", email = "ankandolf@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads AT1000 .hd measurement files, computes cumulative fixed-slope
    maximum-likelihood estimates of SRT50 and their model-based standard errors,
    and plots the measurement results. Intended for research and validation,
    not as a validated clinical diagnostic tool.
